OL,3,GNEWSASunday services to return after
OL,4,ANorthern-RMT deal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA deal has been reached between
OL,7,FNorthern and the RMT that will bring to
OL,8,Fan end a long-running dispute.
OL,10,FThe agreement will mean the restoration
OL,11,Fbetween 60 and 80 Sunday services, some
OL,12,Fof which have not run for up to two
OL,13,Fyears, the company said.
OL,15,FThe dispute centred around working
OL,16,Farrangements for staff and regularly
OL,17,Fled to services being cancelled over
OL,18,Fthe last nine years.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
